WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 11=

01:38.555 --> 01:40.580
I don't have that much time.
I'm very busy.

01:40.860 --> 01:41.740
What you need to do

01:41.740 --> 01:43.660
is lay out all the details and pricing

01:44.140 --> 01:46.060
clearly and directly for me.

01:46.260 --> 01:47.700
No need for all those packages,

01:47.860 --> 01:49.140
and don't go in circles.

01:49.340 --> 01:51.266
What I want is speed,
the faster the better.

01:51.660 --> 01:52.220
No problem.

01:52.580 --> 01:52.980
Mr. Cai,

01:53.500 --> 01:54.020
rest assured.

01:56.100 --> 01:56.780
But Mr. Cai,

01:57.140 --> 01:58.060
marriage

01:58.140 --> 01:59.260
is a lifelong matter.

01:59.340 --> 02:00.460
It shouldn't be rushed.

02:01.620 --> 02:02.980
It's not my first marriage.

02:03.060 --> 02:04.700
It wasn't this complicated before.

02:06.666 --> 02:08.540
Run the numbers first.
I have a friend coming.

02:08.977 --> 02:09.844
Alright, Mr. Cai.

02:13.755 --> 02:15.200
Ms. Lin, what a coincidence.

02:15.420 --> 02:16.088
You're here too.

02:17.020 --> 02:17.840
(Meant to Be)
What a coincidence.

02:17.866 --> 02:19.911
I just happened to meet a friend here.

02:20.500 --> 02:21.822
How has Zhangzhu been lately?

02:22.220 --> 02:23.177
She's doing well.

02:23.660 --> 02:24.940
Eating well, sleeping well,

02:25.300 --> 02:26.900
and her work is progressing steadily.

02:28.620 --> 02:29.980
I've been meaning

02:30.220 --> 02:31.500
to ask you to talk to her

02:31.500 --> 02:32.580
about attending my wedding.

02:32.755 --> 02:34.020
You see, I'm getting married,

02:34.020 --> 02:35.990
and so many friends
from society will be there.

02:36.244 --> 02:37.820
If my own daughter doesn't show up,

02:38.311 --> 02:39.533
it just doesn't look right.

02:40.133 --> 02:41.340
I'll pass along your message

02:41.340 --> 02:42.577
to Zhangzhu when I get back.

02:42.660 --> 02:44.580
But whether she goes or not,

02:44.900 --> 02:45.540
you may

02:45.740 --> 02:47.620
still have to respect her choice.

02:49.700 --> 02:50.300
Ms. Lin,

02:51.260 --> 02:53.460
respect goes both ways.

02:54.060 --> 02:54.980
I respect her.

02:55.420 --> 02:56.220
Does she respect me?

02:57.340 --> 02:57.780
Yes,

02:58.860 --> 03:00.820
my marriages
have had their ups and downs,

03:01.266 --> 03:02.820
but when it comes to my daughter,

03:02.820 --> 03:04.533
I've always given her
everything she wanted.

03:04.580 --> 03:06.140
I've done my best

03:06.340 --> 03:07.822
to make sure she never suffered.

03:08.700 --> 03:10.500
And her mother passed away.

03:10.940 --> 03:11.980
We didn't divorce.

03:12.700 --> 03:13.740
I didn't abandon her.

03:14.260 --> 03:16.260
And her illness
wasn't caused by me either.

03:16.580 --> 03:17.860
I still have to live my life.

03:19.060 --> 03:20.620
You keep telling her things like

03:21.820 --> 03:22.460
independence,

03:23.420 --> 03:24.380
personality,

03:24.980 --> 03:25.940
and freedom.

03:26.340 --> 03:27.500
Don't I also have

03:27.500 --> 03:29.060
the right to pursue my own freedom?

03:30.020 --> 03:31.660
When I encounter a new chapter in life,

03:31.860 --> 03:33.140
shouldn't she also

03:33.333 --> 03:35.222
give me more encouragement and support?

03:35.500 --> 03:35.940
Right?

03:38.060 --> 03:40.060
Zhangzhu is already an adult.

03:40.620 --> 03:41.700
She's not a child anymore.

03:42.220 --> 03:43.580
She has her own judgment.

03:44.688 --> 03:45.780
This isn't the first time

03:45.780 --> 03:47.355
you've asked her to attend your wedding.

03:47.500 --> 03:48.180
Of course,

03:48.300 --> 03:49.820
this is the first time she's refused.

03:50.577 --> 03:52.100
She hasn't opposed your remarriage.

03:52.100 --> 03:53.220
In a way,

03:53.580 --> 03:54.340
that already shows

03:54.700 --> 03:56.500
her support for you

03:56.500 --> 03:57.860
finding a new life.

03:58.340 --> 04:00.644
As for what you said
about independence and freedom,

04:01.060 --> 04:02.380
first you need to distinguish

04:02.660 --> 04:03.780
between your life

04:04.260 --> 04:06.020
and your daughter's life.

04:06.420 --> 04:06.780
Right?

04:06.780 --> 04:07.580
No matter the age,

04:08.260 --> 04:09.380
basic courtesy

04:09.620 --> 04:11.180
and proper upbringing still matter.

04:11.420 --> 04:13.380
But that doesn't include
being repeatedly forced

04:13.380 --> 04:14.866
to attend her father's weddings,

04:15.300 --> 04:16.820
being questioned by other guests

04:17.300 --> 04:19.340
about her attitude toward
her new stepmother,

04:19.980 --> 04:20.540
and having

04:20.755 --> 04:22.577
to smile and give her blessings

04:22.780 --> 04:24.400
when she clearly doesn't want to.

04:25.700 --> 04:26.220
Ms. Lin,

04:27.133 --> 04:28.180
have you ever been married?

04:31.060 --> 04:31.420
No.

04:33.220 --> 04:34.660
Then it's hard for you to understand.

04:36.020 --> 04:37.420
You're Zhangzhu's superior.

04:37.780 --> 04:39.260
You seem much older than her,

04:39.740 --> 04:41.340
but both of you are still immature.

04:42.377 --> 04:43.990
You don't understand how the world works

04:44.220 --> 04:46.780
or how to handle relationships.

04:47.900 --> 04:49.580
If what you call handling relationships

04:50.180 --> 04:52.140
is just repeatedly
getting married and divorced,

04:52.380 --> 04:53.900
then I'd rather not understand it.

04:54.780 --> 04:55.180
Mr. Cai,

04:55.266 --> 04:56.377
I've calculated it for you.

04:56.420 --> 04:57.460
Take a look at this figure.

04:57.470 --> 04:58.160
Is it acceptable?

04:58.180 --> 04:59.066
Hold on a moment.

04:59.400 --> 05:00.420
Please calm down, Mr. Cai.

05:00.420 --> 05:00.900
Miss Lin.

05:01.860 --> 05:02.300
Miss Lin.

05:05.460 --> 05:06.377
My friend is here.

05:08.660 --> 05:09.060
Hello.

05:11.220 --> 05:11.580
Hello.

05:14.980 --> 05:15.420
Please sit.

05:17.180 --> 05:17.980
Finally, we meet.

05:22.780 --> 05:23.260
Mr. Cai,

05:23.444 --> 05:25.133
is your friend here for a blind date?

05:25.340 --> 05:25.980
A blind date?

05:27.540 --> 05:28.580
That bracelet she's wearing

05:28.666 --> 05:30.640
is a confirmation token
from a matchmaking platform.

05:30.660 --> 05:31.244
Is that so?

05:31.940 --> 05:34.260
(Meant to Be)

05:34.300 --> 05:35.370
And from what I know,

05:35.370 --> 05:37.060
that platform is quite well known.

05:37.300 --> 05:38.340
And very expensive.

05:39.100 --> 05:39.740
Really?

05:43.022 --> 05:44.133
Then I'll head out first.

05:44.555 --> 05:45.733
How are you getting there?

05:45.844 --> 05:47.755
Riding that. Just two
or three kilometers, very close.

05:47.777 --> 05:48.311
What about you?

05:48.700 --> 05:49.940
I'm nearby. I'll just walk.

05:50.380 --> 05:51.740
Then let's meet on Wednesday.

05:51.860 --> 05:53.133
I'll send you the address later.

05:53.220 --> 05:54.460
Alright, that's great.

05:55.066 --> 05:56.020
May I shake your hand?

05:56.380 --> 05:56.780
Of course.

05:57.444 --> 05:58.711
- Nice to meet you.
- Thank you.

06:02.066 --> 06:03.000
See you on Wednesday.

06:03.500 --> 06:03.860
Ms. Lin.

06:06.580 --> 06:07.860
I wasn't in a good mood just now.

06:08.700 --> 06:09.460
I was thinking,

06:10.044 --> 06:11.500
since Zhangzhu
has been staying with you,

06:11.500 --> 06:13.066
and you've taken such good care of her,

06:13.340 --> 06:14.260
I should thank you.

06:16.340 --> 06:18.020
So about what happened earlier,

06:18.555 --> 06:19.444
I'd like to apologize.

06:21.780 --> 06:22.300
Mr. Cai,

06:22.860 --> 06:23.860
are you always like this,

06:23.860 --> 06:25.666
quick to flare up
and just as quick to cool down?

06:25.711 --> 06:27.020
No, I've just been very busy lately.

06:27.111 --> 06:28.311
It's been frustrating.

06:28.620 --> 06:29.740
That person just now...

06:30.300 --> 06:31.180
Your blind date?

06:32.733 --> 06:33.755
How did you know?

06:34.420 --> 06:35.260
The bracelet.

06:35.911 --> 06:37.860
Those wedding planners
all know their stuff.

06:38.940 --> 06:39.500
That person

06:39.933 --> 06:41.333
isn't a good match for you.

06:43.140 --> 06:43.620
Thank you,

06:44.660 --> 06:46.580
but I can judge my own situation.

06:47.755 --> 06:49.380
The best way
to get over one relationship

06:49.380 --> 06:50.660
is to start another one.

06:51.260 --> 06:52.180
But like that just now,

06:52.333 --> 06:53.555
it won't help you move on.

06:53.755 --> 06:55.660
It will only make you
miss the past even more.

06:56.540 --> 06:57.340
In this regard,

06:57.466 --> 06:58.340
you can trust me.

06:58.580 --> 07:00.060
I have far more experience than you.

07:01.511 --> 07:02.620
How about I give you a ride?

07:02.700 --> 07:04.300
We can talk more in the car.

07:06.420 --> 07:07.460
I'm really sorry

07:07.820 --> 07:08.700
to trouble you again.

07:08.840 --> 07:11.311
Let's talk after you're
done with your work. Goodbye.

07:12.355 --> 07:14.177
Then please help me talk to Zhangzhu.

07:14.755 --> 07:16.666
No matter
how busy things are at the site,

07:17.340 --> 07:19.377
it's nothing compared
to dealing with a woman.

07:19.977 --> 07:21.200
You think it's just

07:21.288 --> 07:23.000
Miss Qian's wedding
that's keeping him busy?

07:24.600 --> 07:25.533
Not even close.

07:27.020 --> 07:28.020
His previous wife...

07:28.311 --> 07:29.660
I can't even remember her name.

07:31.340 --> 07:32.500
Rose, I think.

07:33.020 --> 07:34.500
Whether they've been married,

07:35.340 --> 07:36.580
whether they've been divorced,

07:36.580 --> 07:38.000
he wants to manage it all.

07:42.900 --> 07:43.860
Handling one side,

07:43.860 --> 07:45.940
while eyeing someone new on the other.

07:46.377 --> 07:47.866
Of course, he'd get overwhelmed.

07:47.940 --> 07:49.288
He panics, and then regrets it.

07:49.844 --> 07:52.400
After regretting it, he apologizes,
and it just goes on and on.

07:53.780 --> 07:55.155
So you don't go to the wedding?

08:03.044 --> 08:04.660
Your dad is actually pretty good to you.

08:04.860 --> 08:05.260
Right?

08:09.620 --> 08:11.311
About as good as he is to other women.

08:17.860 --> 08:19.420
I've already attended two weddings.

08:23.140 --> 08:24.460
That's really my limit.

08:29.355 --> 08:31.600
If he gets married again,
I won't go anymore.

08:34.220 --> 08:35.620
Can we move on, Boss?

08:48.644 --> 08:49.488
By the way,

08:49.860 --> 08:50.940
those five new writers,

08:51.100 --> 08:52.755
I didn't get around
to reviewing them earlier

08:52.760 --> 08:54.350
because I was dealing
with He Han's comeback

08:54.360 --> 08:55.311
and its impact on Gu Yan.

08:55.380 --> 08:56.750
But I took some time
these past few days,

08:56.780 --> 08:58.044
and they're actually quite good.

08:58.180 --> 08:59.140
In such a short time,

08:59.140 --> 09:00.700
being able to pick out these writers

09:00.710 --> 09:02.266
shows you really understand the method.

09:02.460 --> 09:03.380
Really, Ms. Lin?

09:03.620 --> 09:05.740
You really think all five are good?

09:06.133 --> 09:07.622
Once Zhiyuan Investment funds come in,

09:07.660 --> 09:08.980
we can sign new authors.

09:09.540 --> 09:11.333
When that happens,
we'll bring all of them in,

09:11.377 --> 09:12.930
and they'll all
be under your management.

09:12.940 --> 09:13.780
Thank you, Ms. Lin.

09:15.466 --> 09:16.333
By the way,

09:16.777 --> 09:18.000
when you were selecting them,

09:18.100 --> 09:19.377
did you follow any principles?

09:33.540 --> 09:34.260
Let me tell you,

09:35.300 --> 09:36.844
just remember these three points.

09:37.460 --> 09:38.420
There are

09:40.260 --> 09:41.220
three key things.

09:48.740 --> 09:49.780
First...

09:50.140 --> 09:50.580
First,

09:51.244 --> 09:53.355
the most important thing
is the writer's attitude.

09:53.533 --> 09:54.644
They have to be serious.

09:55.100 --> 09:56.700
That attitude has to be right.

09:58.500 --> 10:00.460
Second...

10:03.380 --> 10:05.500
You must introduce your characters.

10:05.700 --> 10:07.100
Every chapter needs conflict,

10:07.180 --> 10:08.420
every part needs progression,

10:08.580 --> 10:09.820
and there must be characters.

10:10.220 --> 10:10.580
Right?

10:10.666 --> 10:11.800
You can't spend forever

10:11.910 --> 10:13.288
building some vague world setting

10:13.311 --> 10:15.530
and not show any characters
within the first two chapters.

10:15.540 --> 10:17.688
Lin Zhanqiao will throw
that straight into the trash.

10:17.860 --> 10:20.100
No empty, overblown setups.

10:20.555 --> 10:21.777
In the opening chapters,

10:22.020 --> 10:23.260
your characters must appear.

10:25.340 --> 10:25.660
The...

10:27.740 --> 10:29.180
The third point...

10:31.288 --> 10:32.711
What is the third point?

10:37.980 --> 10:38.460
Third,

10:39.420 --> 10:40.740
this is Lin Zhanqiao's quirk.

10:40.888 --> 10:42.933
She doesn't like purely
virtuous character types.

10:43.900 --> 10:44.620
Your characters

10:44.700 --> 10:47.020
can't show up from the start
with a heart of gold.

10:47.860 --> 10:48.300
Why?

10:50.900 --> 10:51.900
She thinks it's fake.

10:52.900 --> 10:53.700
She can accept

10:54.220 --> 10:55.380
a pile of trash

10:55.980 --> 10:57.180
with a bit of gold in it,

10:57.780 --> 10:58.740
but she can't accept

10:58.820 --> 10:59.820
a pile of gold

10:59.940 --> 11:01.340
with even a bit of impurity.

11:03.460 --> 11:04.580
What kind of logic is that?

11:05.140 --> 11:06.540
That's why I said it's a quirk.

11:07.500 --> 11:09.420
Lin Zhanqiao has issues with her values.

11:10.780 --> 11:13.140
She doesn't believe
most people are kind and likable.

11:13.500 --> 11:14.740
Unlike me, right?

11:14.933 --> 11:16.066
When I look at people,

11:16.220 --> 11:17.220
especially women,

11:17.620 --> 11:19.580
I see every one of them as wonderful.

11:28.622 --> 11:29.888
Is it inconvenient to say?

11:31.540 --> 11:31.900
No.

11:32.511 --> 11:34.140
The third point is that the character

11:34.820 --> 11:36.900
needs flaws and can't be too perfect.

11:37.733 --> 11:38.844
Who taught you that?

11:43.060 --> 11:44.133
Who taught you that?

11:51.980 --> 11:53.060
Don't say it was me.

12:00.860 --> 12:02.660
No, I figured it out myself.

12:04.940 --> 12:05.500
I asked

12:05.700 --> 12:07.860
Mantou and Fragile

12:08.260 --> 12:10.380
for some of the submissions

12:10.700 --> 12:13.020
you rated highly
when selecting new writers,

12:13.020 --> 12:14.020
and I read all of them.

12:14.444 --> 12:15.088
Ms. Lin.

12:17.980 --> 12:19.060
Ms. Lin, you two go ahead.

12:21.755 --> 12:24.200
There's an issue with Zhiyuan
Investment's contract process.

12:24.220 --> 12:24.900
What issue?

12:25.133 --> 12:27.755
They suspect we inflated the data
for our author development program

12:27.820 --> 12:28.580
and want to reassess it.

12:28.580 --> 12:30.340
But we were already
preparing the contracts.

12:30.540 --> 12:31.660
Why would this happen?

12:38.800 --> 12:39.660
I'm going to Zhiyuan

12:39.860 --> 12:40.900
to see what's going on.

12:40.955 --> 12:41.940
They said they'd give us

12:41.940 --> 12:43.490
a clear explanation
before the end of the day.

12:43.500 --> 12:44.466
We can't wait that long.

12:51.700 --> 12:52.140
Hello, Mei.

12:52.222 --> 12:53.290
There's a problem with Zhiyuan.

12:53.300 --> 12:54.266
I'm heading over now.

12:54.340 --> 12:55.644
I'll come find you after work.

12:56.244 --> 12:57.300
I'm already at Zhiyuan.

12:57.400 --> 12:58.450
I just finished talking to them.

12:58.460 --> 12:59.380
I know what's going on.

12:59.511 --> 13:00.320
I'll come find you.

13:00.780 --> 13:01.420
Okay, got it.

13:33.340 --> 13:34.380
Why are you at Zhiyuan?

13:35.140 --> 13:36.420
I got the news at 10 AM.

13:38.740 --> 13:39.940
Zhiyuan said someone

13:39.940 --> 13:41.288
had already contacted Chenxing.

13:41.940 --> 13:42.820
Who told you?

13:43.060 --> 13:44.300
Who else?

13:45.340 --> 13:47.780
If I'm helping, I see it through.

13:48.177 --> 13:49.940
Ever since I helped you
negotiate last time,

13:49.940 --> 13:51.160
I've been keeping an eye on it.

13:51.180 --> 13:52.860
No news is good news.

13:53.244 --> 13:54.460
But something came up today,

13:54.580 --> 13:55.740
so I went over immediately.

13:58.260 --> 13:59.020
Mei is in charge,

13:59.340 --> 13:59.860
efficient,

14:00.500 --> 14:01.220
just as expected.

14:01.980 --> 14:02.660
Of course.

14:03.044 --> 14:04.260
Otherwise, all these years,

14:04.260 --> 14:05.740
with so many people
trying to bring me down,

14:05.740 --> 14:06.711
I wouldn't still be here.

14:08.140 --> 14:08.860
So what exactly

14:08.860 --> 14:10.100
did you find out at Zhiyuan?

14:12.260 --> 14:13.060
Zhang Yousen...

14:13.688 --> 14:15.111
Why are you two together?

14:15.580 --> 14:16.555
I asked him to come.

14:18.980 --> 14:21.020
Have all the new author contracts

14:21.066 --> 14:22.644
you reported to Zhiyuan been signed?

14:22.980 --> 14:23.740
Not all of them.

14:25.140 --> 14:26.580
Authors are approved one by one,

14:26.711 --> 14:28.400
terms are negotiated one by one,

14:28.533 --> 14:29.490
contracts are processed,

14:29.540 --> 14:30.220
and then signed.

14:30.980 --> 14:32.300
It's impossible for all of them

14:32.460 --> 14:34.177
to be at the same stage
at the same time.

14:34.422 --> 14:36.111
Then for the ones that have been signed,

14:36.177 --> 14:37.311
have they all been paid?

14:37.740 --> 14:38.460
Same logic.

14:38.733 --> 14:40.311
What percentage has been paid?

14:41.220 --> 14:41.900
Some of them.

14:46.380 --> 14:47.340
I did plan

14:48.420 --> 14:49.740
to use Zhiyuan Investment's funds

14:50.580 --> 14:52.180
to pay most of the authors' deposits.

14:54.140 --> 14:55.740
And I stated it very clearly

14:55.740 --> 14:56.860
in the financing report.

14:57.380 --> 14:59.010
Most of the financing would be used

14:59.010 --> 15:01.020
to develop and discover new authors.

15:01.340 --> 15:02.740
That depends on the terms

15:03.288 --> 15:04.977
you negotiated with the new authors.

15:05.140 --> 15:05.980
Generally speaking,

15:06.260 --> 15:07.540
if the contract only takes effect

15:07.860 --> 15:09.180
after payment,

15:09.533 --> 15:10.622
then right now,

15:10.644 --> 15:12.660
performance of the contract
hasn't started yet.

15:14.140 --> 15:15.100
Sir, your water.

15:15.300 --> 15:15.740
Thank you.

15:17.540 --> 15:19.020
In cases like this,

15:19.822 --> 15:21.355
there is usually a whistleblower.

15:21.933 --> 15:23.155
A whistleblower for what?

15:25.222 --> 15:26.666
Zhiyuan Investment has never

15:26.755 --> 15:28.940
raised any doubts
about these issues before.

15:30.380 --> 15:32.620
And they've seen our
communication progress

15:33.140 --> 15:34.580
with the authors

15:34.644 --> 15:36.100
and all copies of the contracts.

15:36.340 --> 15:37.380
Then, is it possible

15:37.700 --> 15:39.180
to pay all the deposits

15:39.460 --> 15:40.180
we can now?

15:40.820 --> 15:43.060
As for the rest that are still
going through the process,

15:43.333 --> 15:45.444
we may need
to make some changes there too.

15:49.700 --> 15:51.300
If we pay everything now,

15:52.888 --> 15:55.177
the company really doesn't
have that much money.

15:56.300 --> 15:57.460
Pay as much as we can.

15:59.180 --> 16:00.980
If I pay all this money out,

16:02.488 --> 16:03.644
and Zhiyuan Investment

16:03.688 --> 16:05.200
withdraws its investment in me,

16:05.780 --> 16:07.860
then I won't have money
left for anything else.

16:10.860 --> 16:11.460
Rent,

16:12.300 --> 16:13.466
and staff salaries...

16:15.733 --> 16:17.222
I won't be able to cover them.

16:22.020 --> 16:23.220
I have another concern.

16:23.733 --> 16:26.066
Could the news have reached Zhiyuan
because some authors

16:26.580 --> 16:27.860
have already walked away?

16:37.911 --> 16:39.320
The three of us
contacted them separately.

16:39.333 --> 16:40.810
Fragile and I each
made more than a dozen calls.

16:40.810 --> 16:41.500
Zhangzhu was still in charge of

16:41.500 --> 16:42.800
the five new authors from before.

16:42.820 --> 16:43.340
Results?

16:43.700 --> 16:44.540
I made twelve calls.

16:44.540 --> 16:45.460
Seven are in the contract process.

16:45.460 --> 16:46.220
One has already been paid.

16:46.220 --> 16:48.300
The remaining four have signed
but haven't been paid yet.

16:48.340 --> 16:49.860
Of those,
two didn't answer their phones.

16:49.860 --> 16:51.140
One is waiting for our payment.

16:51.140 --> 16:52.488
And the last one clearly said

16:52.711 --> 16:54.660
they won't work with us anymore.

16:54.733 --> 16:56.977
If they're not working with us,
who are they working with?

16:57.580 --> 16:58.580
It's...

17:00.740 --> 17:02.300
Ms. Lin, I contacted ten people.

17:02.620 --> 17:04.260
I think we've lost three new authors.

17:04.460 --> 17:05.780
Other companies got to them first.

17:05.940 --> 17:06.420
Three?

17:08.740 --> 17:09.180
Ms. Lin.

17:09.420 --> 17:10.060
Don't rush.

17:10.711 --> 17:11.488
Take your time.

17:12.060 --> 17:12.700
All five of them

17:13.140 --> 17:13.900
left together.

17:16.733 --> 17:17.644
What do you mean?

17:18.111 --> 17:20.140
He said they don't want
to work with us anymore.

17:20.260 --> 17:20.940
The reason?

17:21.380 --> 17:22.740
Other companies approached them.

17:24.340 --> 17:24.940
They...

17:30.340 --> 17:31.180
The five of them

17:31.180 --> 17:32.260
don't even know each other,

17:32.260 --> 17:33.780
and they're not even in the same city.

17:35.500 --> 17:37.300
Someone managed
to reach all five of them.

17:42.420 --> 17:43.060
Zhangzhu,

17:43.422 --> 17:45.622
you know that this kind
of author information

17:45.644 --> 17:46.911
must be kept confidential, right?

17:47.020 --> 17:48.500
Of course. Ms. Lin told me that.

17:50.340 --> 17:50.900
I swear,

17:50.900 --> 17:53.020
I never let their information
leave this office.

17:54.980 --> 17:56.540
Do we know which company they went to?

17:56.780 --> 17:57.890
I asked, but they wouldn't say.

17:57.940 --> 17:58.911
Find out immediately.

18:09.422 --> 18:11.240
(When problems
keep coming one after another,)

18:11.740 --> 18:12.500
(there's no time)

18:12.780 --> 18:14.180
(for frustration or regret to grow.)

18:15.222 --> 18:16.422
(The only way forward)

18:16.700 --> 18:18.540
(is to deal with each one calmly,)

18:18.740 --> 18:20.333
(pressing on until you're exhausted,)

18:20.488 --> 18:21.822
(either solving the trouble,)

18:22.100 --> 18:23.300
(or being consumed by it.)

18:54.300 --> 18:57.220
(Find a nice place tonight.
Buy me a drink.)

19:02.100 --> 19:04.140
(Deal.)

20:01.460 --> 20:02.100
Wait for me.

20:03.540 --> 20:04.380
Just leave it here.

20:04.700 --> 20:05.140
Thanks.

20:08.500 --> 20:08.860
Mr. Ling.

20:09.140 --> 20:09.500
Mr. Ling.

20:11.755 --> 20:12.711
What's going on?

20:13.340 --> 20:14.100
Moving offices.

20:14.333 --> 20:15.955
Wasn't the previous one fine?

20:16.688 --> 20:19.311
The feng shui master said having
no backing behind me is bad.

20:19.620 --> 20:20.820
This room suits me better.

20:21.022 --> 20:22.933
What, are you saving
the other one for someone?

20:23.340 --> 20:23.780
No.

20:26.980 --> 20:28.460
That office was too far from you.

20:28.666 --> 20:29.933
This one is right next to yours.

20:30.022 --> 20:30.720
More convenient.

20:36.220 --> 20:37.400
You sold the apartment?

20:37.860 --> 20:39.822
I told you I could raise
at least seven million.

20:39.940 --> 20:40.860
I wasn't joking.

20:41.660 --> 20:42.980
You said this is our company.

20:43.660 --> 20:44.900
I hope you're not joking either.

20:47.780 --> 20:48.466
Don't worry.

20:48.700 --> 20:50.400
I'll use the money where it matters.

20:53.020 --> 20:53.620
After work,

20:53.620 --> 20:55.355
come over to my new place for dinner.

20:56.777 --> 20:58.420
Money's tight during this startup phase,

20:58.420 --> 20:59.822
so I couldn't get a great place,

21:00.060 --> 21:01.340
but I think you'll like it.

21:05.600 --> 21:06.844
You'll see when you come.

21:43.020 --> 21:46.300
(I'm starving. Come early. Can't wait.)

21:48.460 --> 21:50.460
(As soon as possible.)

21:55.820 --> 21:57.100
Gu Yan's update just came in.

22:00.311 --> 22:02.377
Good thing you reminded me.
I almost forgot.

22:02.740 --> 22:03.220
Zhangzhu.

22:05.500 --> 22:05.860
Ms. Lin.

22:06.740 --> 22:07.620
Let Gu Yan know

22:08.700 --> 22:10.300
there's something urgent at the company.

22:10.860 --> 22:11.940
I'll contact him tonight.

22:12.340 --> 22:12.660
Got it.

22:13.020 --> 22:13.900
I'm heading out now.

22:14.111 --> 22:15.377
Call me if anything comes up.

22:15.500 --> 22:15.860
Okay.

22:45.780 --> 22:46.180
Hello.

22:47.860 --> 22:48.540
I'm on the way.

22:48.660 --> 22:49.577
I'll be there soon.

22:50.580 --> 22:51.300
Alright, see you.

23:36.980 --> 23:38.020
What took you so long?

23:38.620 --> 23:39.220
Sorry.

23:39.500 --> 23:40.780
Something urgent came up.

23:41.100 --> 23:42.140
I almost couldn't make it.

23:43.860 --> 23:45.311
If no one's dead, it's not urgent.

23:46.540 --> 23:47.340
When did you arrive?

23:47.700 --> 23:48.711
A couple of days ago.

23:48.800 --> 23:49.740
I've already ordered.

23:49.910 --> 23:51.044
You can add more if you want.

23:51.088 --> 23:51.800
Excuse me.

23:52.755 --> 23:53.977
Could we order, please?

23:57.133 --> 23:58.200
Alright, thank you.

23:58.580 --> 23:59.540
A vegetable salad,

23:59.900 --> 24:01.660
and a room temperature soda. Thank you.

24:01.780 --> 24:02.100
Wait.

24:02.660 --> 24:03.700
You're not getting a drink?

24:04.060 --> 24:04.940
I'll pass.

24:04.940 --> 24:06.580
I still have work to deal with later.

24:07.180 --> 24:07.940
One drink

24:07.940 --> 24:09.260
won't delay your work.

24:09.580 --> 24:10.180
If you

24:11.180 --> 24:12.500
can't handle it,

24:12.500 --> 24:14.466
you won't handle it
even without drinking.

24:14.555 --> 24:15.580
Here. Get her a drink, too.

24:15.700 --> 24:16.420
Same with me.

24:24.180 --> 24:24.900
Okay. That's all.

24:25.540 --> 24:25.940
Thank you.

24:26.555 --> 24:27.866
Just leave the decanter here.

24:28.140 --> 24:28.580
Enjoy.

24:33.100 --> 24:34.980
I haven't even had lunch yet.

24:35.660 --> 24:36.380
At that hotel,

24:36.511 --> 24:37.800
everything is so expensive.

24:38.460 --> 24:40.540
That little rascal
made me pay for everything.

24:40.955 --> 24:42.711
Don't you think he's heartless?

24:42.911 --> 24:44.311
Doesn't that count as elder abuse?

24:45.740 --> 24:47.020
Why did you suddenly come here?

24:51.420 --> 24:53.220
I moved into a retirement home.

24:59.660 --> 25:00.060
You...

25:00.580 --> 25:02.340
When you get the chance,

25:03.020 --> 25:05.460
come visit me once a month, alright?

25:06.580 --> 25:07.980
Bring me something from Shanghai.

25:16.220 --> 25:16.980
Does He Han know?

25:17.820 --> 25:18.380
He does.

25:19.620 --> 25:20.380
You know how it is.

25:20.844 --> 25:22.000
Between him and me,

25:22.688 --> 25:23.888
out of sight, out of mind.

25:26.140 --> 25:26.580
Hello,

25:26.780 --> 25:27.460
your dishes.

25:32.260 --> 25:33.420
Time to eat.

25:34.500 --> 25:35.620
Tomahawk steak.

25:37.420 --> 25:38.311
You ordered this?

25:39.740 --> 25:40.620
You're paying,

25:40.740 --> 25:41.540
so I'll eat more.

25:42.888 --> 25:44.180
Once I'm in the retirement home,

25:44.300 --> 25:45.555
I won't get to eat this anymore.

25:47.140 --> 25:48.100
It's fine to eat.

25:48.180 --> 25:49.340
Just don't overdo it.

25:50.020 --> 25:50.730
Too much

25:50.730 --> 25:51.620
is hard to digest.

25:51.860 --> 25:53.377
If it's hard to digest, that's fine.

25:54.340 --> 25:55.740
Drink more wine and it'll go down.

25:57.060 --> 25:57.380
Here.

25:59.500 --> 26:00.980
This drink is for you,

26:01.200 --> 26:02.800
for getting out of that mess.

26:05.540 --> 26:06.540
What mess?

26:07.140 --> 26:08.511
You broke up with that rascal.

26:09.780 --> 26:10.490
He's the type

26:10.490 --> 26:11.844
who never lasts with anyone.

26:12.860 --> 26:13.500
Before,

26:13.500 --> 26:15.540
every time I saw you, I warned you

26:15.900 --> 26:17.860
not to be fooled
by his outward appearance.

26:17.940 --> 26:18.933
You wouldn't listen.

26:20.111 --> 26:22.511
If things were good for a while,
fine, let them be.

26:23.022 --> 26:25.355
But if you thought you
could turn something temporary

26:25.400 --> 26:26.777
into something lasting,

26:27.377 --> 26:28.577
then you're finished.

26:28.700 --> 26:30.622
You wouldn't even know
how you lost everything.

26:31.700 --> 26:32.860
Now I know.

26:36.066 --> 26:37.777
The moment he broke up with you,

26:38.177 --> 26:39.066
look at that,

26:39.755 --> 26:41.466
he immediately found someone else.

26:42.860 --> 26:43.650
Before,

26:43.650 --> 26:45.500
he always went for younger ones.

26:45.980 --> 26:47.180
When you were with him,

26:47.180 --> 26:48.777
you weren't that old either, right?

26:48.933 --> 26:50.777
This time, who knows what he's thinking,

26:50.977 --> 26:52.244
he found someone older.

26:53.060 --> 26:53.700
This won't work.

26:56.260 --> 26:57.660
Otherwise I wouldn't have asked you

26:57.980 --> 26:59.022
to come drink with me.

27:01.740 --> 27:02.460
What do you mean?

27:34.140 --> 27:34.940
Who are you?

27:38.860 --> 27:39.380
Who are you?

27:40.980 --> 27:42.060
You're Uncle He, right?

27:43.460 --> 27:44.300
My name is Dai Shan.

27:44.300 --> 27:46.780
I'm He Han's agent and editor.

27:49.220 --> 27:50.580
He's inside?

27:52.060 --> 27:52.780
I'll go get him?

27:53.460 --> 27:53.900
No.

27:56.340 --> 27:57.020
Come.

28:02.980 --> 28:03.940
Let's not disturb him.

28:04.460 --> 28:05.133
How about this?

28:05.740 --> 28:06.900
Down in the lobby,

28:07.860 --> 28:08.500
at the bar,

28:08.900 --> 28:09.660
buy me a drink,

28:10.420 --> 28:11.540
and I'll tell you

28:12.180 --> 28:13.100
his whole story

28:13.260 --> 28:13.780
growing up.

28:14.900 --> 28:16.180
I'm not interested

28:16.260 --> 28:17.220
in his life story.

28:18.020 --> 28:20.140
Then you won't be able

28:20.222 --> 28:21.755
to understand him at the root.

28:21.900 --> 28:24.100
I'm only interested
in how much money he makes.

28:24.620 --> 28:25.460
Money matters,

28:25.460 --> 28:27.066
but where he comes from matters too.

28:27.260 --> 28:28.860
People say, you can tell a lot

28:28.980 --> 28:30.288
about someone from a young age.

28:30.488 --> 28:31.666
Not even that young.

28:31.980 --> 28:32.940
When he was eight,

28:33.140 --> 28:34.100
something happened.

28:34.940 --> 28:36.900
That one incident

28:37.200 --> 28:38.444
set the tone for his whole life.

28:39.940 --> 28:41.660
Want to know what it was?

28:42.866 --> 28:43.500
Have a drink.

28:45.140 --> 28:45.900
Not interested.

28:45.980 --> 28:46.540
Sorry.

28:50.340 --> 28:51.700
So what was it?

28:52.044 --> 28:53.355
What do you mean what?

28:53.540 --> 28:55.260
That thing when he was eight.

28:57.311 --> 28:58.666
I haven't thought it through yet.

29:00.755 --> 29:02.260
If she won't buy me a drink,

29:02.260 --> 29:03.610
then I won't bother making it up.

29:05.340 --> 29:07.180
So all those stories

29:07.180 --> 29:08.220
you told me before,

29:08.300 --> 29:09.180
they were all made up?

29:11.020 --> 29:11.620
Not entirely.

29:13.420 --> 29:14.180
Now I see

29:14.180 --> 29:15.660
why He Han writes novels.

29:19.700 --> 29:20.940
Even if they're made up,

29:21.155 --> 29:22.822
there's always some truth behind them.

29:23.100 --> 29:23.860
You know that.

29:25.000 --> 29:26.555
No matter how you dress it up,

29:26.820 --> 29:27.780
a jerk is still a jerk.

29:28.580 --> 29:30.460
That part is absolutely true.

29:42.220 --> 29:42.580
This way.

29:53.977 --> 29:55.022
Turn left here.

30:16.088 --> 30:17.355
Why rent a place here?

30:18.177 --> 30:20.777
With this budget,
you can't get anything good anywhere.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.911
Might as well pick somewhere meaningful.

30:23.066 --> 30:24.466
What's meaningful about this place?

30:24.860 --> 30:25.780
It's where you grew up.

30:27.340 --> 30:28.860
I want to know how you grew up,

30:29.177 --> 30:30.880
and what drove you
to push yourself so hard.

30:31.140 --> 30:32.340
Is it the same reason as me?

30:36.333 --> 30:38.022
Your grandmother still lives here.

30:38.300 --> 30:39.711
I can go visit her for you.

30:55.740 --> 30:56.980
When you visit her,

30:57.777 --> 30:59.088
don't move things around.

31:01.060 --> 31:02.500
Her eyesight isn't good anymore.

31:03.740 --> 31:04.460
Everything

31:05.500 --> 31:06.660
has to stay in its place.

31:08.022 --> 31:09.911
Didn't you hire
someone to take care of her?

31:09.980 --> 31:10.580
I did.

31:14.066 --> 31:15.466
There's a caretaker during the day,

31:15.533 --> 31:17.555
but grandmother
won't turn on the lights at night.

31:18.022 --> 31:19.266
The caretakers can't stand it,

31:19.555 --> 31:20.622
and they don't stay.

31:32.977 --> 31:34.755
Can you really get used
to living like this?

31:36.060 --> 31:37.860
This kind of hardship is nothing to me.

31:38.940 --> 31:40.260
As long as I know my goal,

31:40.900 --> 31:41.780
I can endure it.

31:43.500 --> 31:44.660
I really don't understand you.

31:45.580 --> 31:46.580
I've told you before.

31:49.044 --> 31:50.355
Then I'll say it again.

31:51.933 --> 31:53.355
I want Colorful Culture Media

31:53.377 --> 31:54.822
to have a place in the industry.

31:55.140 --> 31:56.220
I want you and me

31:56.780 --> 31:58.220
to become leaders in this field.

32:01.260 --> 32:03.300
Before, it was Lin Zhanqiao and He Han.

32:03.888 --> 32:06.288
In the future,
it will be Zhao Lanxin and Ling Yikai.

32:08.260 --> 32:10.300
You fought your way up from the slums.

32:11.540 --> 32:12.820
Top middle school,

32:13.300 --> 32:14.380
top university,

32:15.311 --> 32:17.333
and now you've started your own company.

32:18.244 --> 32:19.400
You've worked this hard

32:20.460 --> 32:22.100
just to be seen, right?

32:24.860 --> 32:25.940
We're the same.

32:28.977 --> 32:30.066
What are you doing?

32:33.500 --> 32:34.660
You planned all this,

32:35.980 --> 32:36.660
brought me here,

32:38.740 --> 32:39.780
just to say these things?

32:42.740 --> 32:43.580
Did it work?

32:56.540 --> 32:57.420
Last drink.

33:02.180 --> 33:03.580
Tell me,

33:05.220 --> 33:06.420
a person who loves drinking

33:07.740 --> 33:09.220
but never gets drunk.

33:11.140 --> 33:12.540
Doesn't that sound contradictory?

33:15.140 --> 33:16.260
Do you know why

33:16.860 --> 33:17.580
I was so good

33:17.580 --> 33:19.380
at selling machines back then?

33:20.300 --> 33:22.740
Because I never got drunk.

33:22.866 --> 33:23.820
If they wouldn't pay,

33:24.600 --> 33:25.859
I'd grab a bottle of aged liquor

33:25.860 --> 33:27.377
and down it right in front of them.

33:27.400 --> 33:28.720
Then they would sign on the spot.

33:28.940 --> 33:30.740
And I even had to pretend to be drunk.

33:34.022 --> 33:35.888
Heavy drinking runs in the family.

33:40.340 --> 33:41.140
He Han?

33:42.088 --> 33:43.088
He can't do it.

33:43.533 --> 33:44.777
He doesn't have it in him.

33:46.660 --> 33:48.460
Two drinks and his hands start shaking.

33:48.660 --> 33:50.860
One more sip
and his whole body trembles.

33:51.133 --> 33:52.622
What kind of problem is that?

33:54.820 --> 33:56.100
Someone who loves drinking

33:58.380 --> 33:59.580
can't handle alcohol?

34:02.100 --> 34:02.820
That's a curse.

34:05.740 --> 34:07.260
It's punishment from heaven.

34:12.333 --> 34:14.422
If he doesn't drink, he feels miserable.

34:15.222 --> 34:16.888
If he drinks, he's ruining himself.

34:18.977 --> 34:20.844
If that's not a curse, what is?

34:34.660 --> 34:36.100
He Wei, dinner's ready.

34:54.860 --> 34:55.740
Your phone is ringing.

35:02.980 --> 35:03.260
Hello?

35:03.660 --> 35:04.220
Where are you?

35:05.940 --> 35:06.980
Zhanqiao is treating me

35:07.340 --> 35:08.140
to steak.

35:09.060 --> 35:09.820
Tomahawk.

35:25.300 --> 35:25.900
I'm sorry.

35:26.355 --> 35:27.688
Please help me get him back.

36:28.980 --> 36:30.420
You've been drinking a lot lately.

36:31.511 --> 36:33.022
Too many happy occasions.

36:33.580 --> 36:33.900
Right.

36:34.420 --> 36:35.822
Happy occasions call for drinks.

36:51.580 --> 36:52.220
Don't think

36:53.260 --> 36:55.340
I'm just some failure.

36:57.580 --> 36:59.380
He Han writes well now

37:00.066 --> 37:01.355
and makes good money.

37:01.420 --> 37:02.460
He should thank me.

37:02.700 --> 37:03.580
No pain,

37:04.220 --> 37:05.180
no gain.

37:05.980 --> 37:07.500
I gave him life experience.

37:09.220 --> 37:11.020
A kid raised in comfort

37:11.422 --> 37:13.577
would never understand
bitterness and hardship.

37:14.933 --> 37:16.200
So when it comes to many things,

37:16.300 --> 37:17.866
you can't just look at one side.

37:20.860 --> 37:21.780
Have you ever thought

37:23.177 --> 37:25.222
that he might rather not
have all this money,

37:26.100 --> 37:26.940
if he could

37:27.580 --> 37:28.820
erase all the pain

37:28.820 --> 37:30.260
you put him through?

37:32.400 --> 37:33.460
Now that he has money,

37:33.460 --> 37:34.500
of course, he'd say that.

37:35.460 --> 37:36.220
If he didn't,

37:36.444 --> 37:37.955
you'd see what he'd say then.

37:41.100 --> 37:41.820
People...

37:43.060 --> 37:44.340
are born to suffer.

37:46.500 --> 37:47.940
If it's not one kind, it's another.

37:49.488 --> 37:51.810
That bit of hardship he went through,
you call that suffering?

37:51.822 --> 37:52.733
That's what you call

37:54.140 --> 37:54.820
experience.

37:55.740 --> 37:56.180
Right?

37:57.260 --> 37:59.140
But you almost got him killed.

37:59.644 --> 38:01.044
He smashed my wine bottle.

38:01.111 --> 38:02.555
I hit him, and he deserved it.

38:03.555 --> 38:04.980
Why couldn't he just talk things out?

38:04.980 --> 38:06.111
Why grab the bottle?

38:06.488 --> 38:07.740
A whole bottle of fine liquor,

38:07.822 --> 38:09.244
and he smashed it on the ground.

38:10.580 --> 38:11.540
He fell

38:11.620 --> 38:13.060
and hit the broken glass himself.

38:13.700 --> 38:15.660
If I hadn't gotten him
to the hospital in time,

38:15.820 --> 38:16.977
he would have gone blind.

38:21.300 --> 38:22.180
You try it.

38:22.180 --> 38:23.540
Go grab his bottle now.

38:23.666 --> 38:25.020
See if he slaps you or not.

38:44.220 --> 38:44.660
Alright.

38:44.780 --> 38:46.266
You should head back and rest.

38:46.280 --> 38:47.660
It's fine. I'll walk you upstairs.

38:47.660 --> 38:48.380
No need.

38:49.300 --> 38:50.860
It's late. A woman following me up...

38:51.088 --> 38:52.900
People will think
I picked you up at a bar.

38:52.900 --> 38:53.940
It's fine.

38:55.460 --> 38:56.540
Let him go up on his own.

38:58.860 --> 38:59.540
How much was it?

38:59.740 --> 39:00.822
I'll transfer it to you.

39:01.380 --> 39:01.940
Two thousand.

39:03.180 --> 39:04.220
Lin Zhanqiao treated me.

39:04.580 --> 39:05.140
It was free.

39:05.400 --> 39:06.140
No need to pay.

39:08.780 --> 39:09.460
See?

39:09.540 --> 39:11.180
Meals are meant to be paid for.

39:14.940 --> 39:15.460
Zhanqiao,

39:16.180 --> 39:17.060
you've become stingy.

39:17.088 --> 39:18.533
If he comes looking for you again,

39:18.577 --> 39:20.000
just say you're busy. Ignore him.

39:28.500 --> 39:28.940
Thanks.

39:32.900 --> 39:33.980
Your dad suddenly came here

39:34.340 --> 39:35.466
and asked me to dinner.

39:35.577 --> 39:37.266
He probably has something in mind.

39:40.100 --> 39:40.540
Got it.

39:41.460 --> 39:42.340
Also, don't hide it.

39:45.140 --> 39:45.900
If you drink later,

39:46.100 --> 39:47.622
you two will end up arguing again.

39:48.340 --> 39:48.900
Don't worry.

39:49.088 --> 39:50.200
I know what I'm doing.

40:13.000 --> 40:13.911
Now this is great.

40:14.577 --> 40:16.777
Zhiyuan Investment
has stopped funding Chenxing.

40:17.420 --> 40:18.540
What about our new authors?

40:18.644 --> 40:20.822
Why do you think
I asked you to raise seven million?

40:21.180 --> 40:22.260
Strike first.

40:22.622 --> 40:23.580
It's all been paid out?

40:23.700 --> 40:24.100
Of course.

40:25.900 --> 40:26.420
How many?

40:26.580 --> 40:27.140
Five.

40:27.222 --> 40:28.777
The rest are still in progress.

40:30.100 --> 40:31.540
Pay first, and handle things later.

40:31.933 --> 40:33.860
Looks like for new authors,
the biggest concern

40:33.980 --> 40:35.780
is how quickly they can get paid.

40:35.980 --> 40:36.930
In the end, where did

40:36.930 --> 40:38.866
Lin Zhanqiao's funding
from Zhiyuan come from?

40:38.955 --> 40:40.511
Taken from what should have gone to us.

40:40.660 --> 40:42.000
If we can't get it, how can she?

40:45.955 --> 40:47.220
Then we take Lin Zhanqiao down.

40:47.220 --> 40:48.260
First, leverage Mr. Fan.

40:49.420 --> 40:50.380
We're going to build

40:51.060 --> 40:51.780
the largest

40:51.900 --> 40:53.180
web fiction content supplier.

40:53.660 --> 40:54.940
Set up training, build a school,

40:54.940 --> 40:56.260
and create our own platform.

40:56.740 --> 40:57.740
Then replace Mr. Fan.

40:57.900 --> 40:59.100
Seven years... Is that enough?

41:00.466 --> 41:02.000
Do we have that kind of patience?

41:02.340 --> 41:02.900
Five years.

41:03.460 --> 41:03.980
Three years.

41:37.140 --> 41:37.740
Ms. Lin,

41:38.980 --> 41:40.940
the new authors I found

41:41.900 --> 41:43.140
have all been poached.

41:47.500 --> 41:48.020
By who?

41:49.740 --> 41:51.420
Let her calm down first.

41:54.620 --> 41:55.540
Colorful Culture Media?

41:57.333 --> 41:58.955
They've already signed them.

41:59.000 --> 42:00.377
All five of them are signed.

42:00.540 --> 42:01.780
They must have offered

42:01.933 --> 42:03.244
more money than we did.

42:12.380 --> 42:13.860
What about

42:14.500 --> 42:15.140
the others?

42:15.900 --> 42:16.660
Not sure yet.

42:17.155 --> 42:18.155
But these ones...

42:18.200 --> 42:19.711
Because they hadn't signed with us yet,

42:19.733 --> 42:21.980
they went ahead and signed
with Colorful Culture Media,

42:21.980 --> 42:22.820
and word got out.

42:24.060 --> 42:25.660
Aren't they worried about disputes?

42:25.860 --> 42:26.820
There's an insider

42:26.900 --> 42:27.580
in your company.

42:29.220 --> 42:30.940
It's not me, really not.

42:31.180 --> 42:33.140
I found all these authors myself.

42:33.140 --> 42:35.140
I wouldn't sabotage my own work.

42:36.022 --> 42:37.866
Did Colorful Culture Media pay you too?

42:39.140 --> 42:41.100
Ms. Mei, money is the last thing I lack.

42:41.340 --> 42:42.460
My father is far wealthier

42:42.460 --> 42:43.822
than Colorful Culture Media.

42:44.020 --> 42:46.300
If you said
she was planted here by He Han,

42:46.300 --> 42:47.220
I'd believe that more.

42:48.900 --> 42:50.377
But Zhao Lanxin and Ling Yikai...

42:51.140 --> 42:51.780
That's unlikely.

42:53.220 --> 42:53.900
Then who is it?

42:54.620 --> 42:55.100
Mantou?

42:56.060 --> 42:56.780
Fragile?

42:57.460 --> 42:58.300
Or Naobaijin?

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
